---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import {services} from '@/data/services'
export function getStaticPaths(){return services.map(service=>({params:{slug:service.id},props:{service}}))}
const {service:s}=Astro.props
---
<BaseLayout title={`${s.title} — Layanan Carisite`} description={s.description}><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><a href="/layanan">← Semua layanan</a><span class="eyebrow detail-eyebrow">Service / {s.number}</span><h1>{s.title}<em>.</em></h1><p>{s.description}</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container detail-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Lingkup awal</span><h2>Yang kita bangun bersama.</h2><ul>{s.deliverables.map(d=><li>↗ {d}</li>)}</ul><h3>Cocok untuk</h3><p>{s.fit}</p><h3>Cara memulai</h3><p>Brief → kesepakatan lingkup → desain → implementasi → pengujian → serah terima. Jadwal, jumlah revisi, masa layanan, dan integrasi dikonfirmasi dalam penawaran.</p><p>Demo menampilkan interaksi simulasi. Backend, pembayaran, login, dan integrasi eksternal membutuhkan lingkup implementasi produksi tersendiri.</p></div><aside><span class="eyebrow">Investment reference</span><h2>{s.price}</h2><p>Harga final mengikuti kebutuhan yang disepakati. Biaya layanan pihak ketiga dan perpanjangan dikonfirmasi terpisah.</p><a class="button button-primary" href={`/kontak?demo=${s.demo}`}>Diskusikan kebutuhan →</a><a class="detail-link" href={`/demo/preview/${s.demo}`}>Coba contoh yang relevan ↗</a></aside></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.detail-eyebrow{display:block;margin-top:3rem}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:6rem}.detail-grid h2{font-size:2.3rem;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.2;margin:1.2rem 0}.detail-grid h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin:2rem 0 .7rem}.detail-grid p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;font-size:.95rem}.detail-grid ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:2rem 0}.detail-grid li{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.detail-grid aside{background:#e5ecd9;padding:2.5rem;align-self:start;border-radius:6px}.detail-grid aside .button{margin-top:1.5rem}.detail-link{display:block;margin-top:1.5rem;font-size:.8rem}@media(max-width:750px){.detail-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem}.detail-grid aside{padding:1.5rem}}</style>
